[en.DECISION_WETM_RESET_BONDS]
Anchor the Exchange

[en.DECISION_WETM_RESET_BONDS_desc]
Manipulate the price of $WETM_DEV_BONDS$, so that it returns to its original price.

[en.DECISION_WETM_RESET_BONDS_TOOLTIP]
$WETM_DEV_BONDS$ will return to its original value (§Y150§! $WETM_DEV_BONDS$ per unit deal)

[zh.DECISION_WETM_RESET_BONDS]
锚定汇率

[zh.DECISION_WETM_RESET_BONDS_desc]
操纵$WETM_DEV_BONDS$的价格，使其恢复到原始的价格。

[zh.DECISION_WETM_RESET_BONDS_TOOLTIP]
$WETM_DEV_BONDS$将会回到其原始价值（每单位交易§Y150§! $WETM_DEV_BONDS$）
